<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">- Ibaas</book>
  <para style="h">BaYahuda</para>
  <para style="toc3">BaYa</para>
  <para style="toc2">BaYahuda</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kufumung fɛ́ ba Jɛk sak na bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba yet baYahuda</para>
  <para style="mt1">BaYahuda</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kufumung fɛ́ ba <optbreak /> Jɛk sak na bafi ikuus <optbreak /> fɛ́ ba yet baYahuda</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1" />
  <para style="s">Adakunom cɛɛt nanu Arim wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1" />Gbang-gbang yame, Adakunom kin cɛɛt ne bada badakop yit ne nanu batan ni nzam izén ni irén zizɛɛt. <verse eid="HEB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2" />Awɛt ni izen iyeng, fi i yet ifi igang e, a cɛɛt ne yit nanu Arim wu. Ni iwu fɛ́ Adakunom kin di nye kazatse ngma. Adakunom sak Arim wu me na sot anet iya itekari azaton akaakyi ikyɛng. <verse eid="HEB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3" />Arim wu me, wu fɛ́ a yet mgbey ízɔk Adakunom, a tɛ yet atutup nse Adakunom. Iwu fɛ́ a bereng kaakyi ikyɛng nek agap ifɛ̀ wu. Ama fɛ́ a mi kusu anɛn yit, a da ne sonong azanɛn ni bɔk iyak Agbat Azɔk Bazɔk. <verse eid="HEB 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4" />Ízɔk Arim Adakunom e naat agap ifɛ́ batomaza ni iratek, kyɔn ti iyerek fɛ́ Adakunom ku nɔk iwat nfuba me.<verse eid="HEB 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso naat batomaza ni iratek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5" />Angan ayɛt batomaza me fɛ́ Adakunom kin man fɛ̀ ni wu ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">&lt;&lt;Ngɔn yet Arim hom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">atut imi mi sot Ada ngɔn ɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 1:5">Kɛ na tɛ na fɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">&lt;&lt;In da sot Ada wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">ni iwu da sot</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">Arim hom ɛ&gt;&gt;?<verse eid="HEB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6" />Awɛt izen fɛ́ Adakunom da tom Arim wu afi imɛsɛng e azatse, a fɛ̀ ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:6">&lt;&lt;Won batomaza ngma kusum</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:6">na ba ku ya ntong.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7" />Azaton batomaza, Adakunom fɛ̀ ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">&lt;&lt;Adakunom sak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">batomaza wu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">na ba sot ti nwun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">nɛ basam wu sot tɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">alem irong.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8" />Awɛt azaton Arim wu me Adakunom fɛ̀ ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">&lt;&lt;Wo Adakunom!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">Won kuta igwɔm ngɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:8">ni ku sot gbakgbak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">ishɛn iya igwɔm ngɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:8">yet ifi ikaba katsak.<verse eid="HEB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9" />Ngɔn shim nggɔn kusot kutabat,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">ni i rangɔn nggɔn anyas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">Nek anɔng, Adakunom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">fɛ́ a yet Adakunom ngɔn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">a mi da kasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">a mi da korok name</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">na fi iyɛ ikan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">fɛ́ na wat na fɛ́ bafidang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10" />A tɛ fɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">&lt;&lt;Wo aTisa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">Neme ni itumung e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:10">ngɔn ta itis azatse,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">nazanɛn yet</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:10">kutomong mbɔk ngɔn.<verse eid="HEB 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11" />Nkyɔrɔk ngma bi gang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:11">in ba akop ti kukpin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:11">awɛt ngɔn sot gbakgbak.<verse eid="HEB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12" />I bi kunung ina</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">ti kunyin-kukpin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">nɛ ba shesheng ina ti nkpin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">Awɛt ngɔn bi di nak anɔng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">kaakyi izen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">ni kutset ngɔn sot vit nkum e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13" />A mang fɛ̀ na angan ayɛt batomaza wu me fok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">&lt;&lt;Sonong ni bɔk iyak hom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">tit ma in sak bafi ifa ngɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">na aben atak ngɔn ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14" />Akyɛ yet batomaza yɛ? Ba yet nabik fɛ́ na ra Adakunom kutomong, na ka ba toos na ba bin di sɛs bayɔng fɛ́ ba bi sɛ isheshek.<verse eid="HEB 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2" />
  <para style="s">Iwees ato ni ifɛ̀ Adakunom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1" />Nek anɔng, i se gbing-gbing ni in ka na nye yit yɛɛt naton ifɛ̀ fi in ma fok yit ide, kɔn in ba sot yit kpɛɛ awo. <verse eid="HEB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2" />Ki ifɛ̀ deng fi ne na batomaza yet atsitsak ifɛ̀, nek anɔng, ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a rawu ishan itabak de, kɛ na sot gbarak, a da shan itabak fi ikyɛm kpaf ni wu, <verse eid="HEB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3" />in da tsang anɛ ni in hwyet yit, ki in rayit agbat-ifɛ̀ isheshek yeng ɛ? Ifɛ̀ isheshek deng fɛ́ aTisa kin man tumung taas e, ba mi ki tonong yit ide wɛshɛk nanu bayɔng fɛ́ ba kin tin fok ide ni wu. <verse eid="HEB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4" />Adakunom tɛ a ban tonong ifɛ̀ wu naton ifɛ̀ bá me, ni irèn ikyɛng idi, ni nkyɔrɔk ayɔɔt, ni ndiri ntomong abes, ni nnang fɛ́ Kabik aJɛrɛ kabasa ina kpaf ni shim wu.<verse eid="HEB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso yet itis isheshek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5" />Igwɔm fi i bi bɛ́ me, idɔng fi in tsin di cɛɛt yit yɔkɔnɔng, da Adakunom nɔɔk batomaza iya igwɔm e awo. <verse eid="HEB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6" />Awɛt ayɛt kufumung Ifɛ̀ Adakunom, anet akak kin cɛɛt ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">&lt;&lt;Wo Adakunom!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">Anet awe yet akyɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">fi ngɔn ka daam ni iwu yɛ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">Kɛ, arim anet yet akyɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">fi i tsin ku bereng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">gyat anɔng ɛ?<verse eid="HEB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7" />I ku sak a sot lɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">na batomaza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">nfi ki izen gyeet.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:7">Awɛt ama me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">i ti ku nɔk ízɔk ni iratek,<verse eid="HEB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8" />i ti i ku nɔk ice iya igwɔm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:8">azaton nkyɔrɔk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:8">ngma kusum.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Izen fɛ́ ba fɛ̀, Adakunom ku sak ice iya igwɔm azaton akaakyi ikyɛng, idɔng itonong fok, vit ikyi ikak fɛ́ a won ide ama. Ngma ne anɔng, yɔkɔnɔng ana, in ma kyem in di yit ice iya igwɔm anet e ni nkyɔrɔk e ngma awo. <verse eid="HEB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9" />Awɛt yɔkɔnɔng, in di yit aYeso fɛ́ ba ku sak a sot lee na batomaza nfi ki izen gyeet. Awɛt ama anɔng, ba ku nɔk ízɔk ni iratek, nek iku izot fɛ́ a sɔ. A yet nek itek Adakunom wu fi i sak a di sɛ iku me nek akaangan.<verse eid="HEB 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10" />A yet Adakunom wu nek ice wu ni nek iwu fɛ́ a nye kaakyi ikyɛng. Nek anɔng, a di i ku se yɛɛt a sak aYeso a shining gyat ni irèn isɔ izot, nɔng a bin di bɛ́ ni nnon dot na ba sɛ kanu kafuba ni ízɔk wu. Nek a yet aYeso wu fɛ́ a yet itis fɛ́ a da ka ba tsaa sak i sɛ isheshek. <verse eid="HEB 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11" />Iwu fɛ́ a kus banet jɛrɛ na anɛn bá, iwu ni ba fɛ̀ ba mi sot jɛrɛ me, ba bɛ̀ Ada azining. Nek anɔng, da aYeso tɛ fok nsum na ka ba yes baruneng awo. <verse eid="HEB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12" />A fɛ̀ na Adakunom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">&lt;&lt;In da taas baruneng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:12">iyerek ngɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:12">nate bafi ikuus ngɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:12">in da ka tere.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13" />A tɛ a fɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">&lt;&lt;In da te yɛndɛng ni wu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:13">A tɛ a fɛ̀ bà,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">&lt;&lt;Di, Imi yo ni nnon fɛ́</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:13">Adakunom ma di nɔk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14" />Ana ke fi nnon anet awe di se ni kurɔm na nasok, aYeso ikyɛng wu a sot nagbɔng ti iba. A ra anɔng e, nɔng nek ni irèn iku wu, a bi di wey ne aShetan fɛ́ a bi ice naton iku. <verse eid="HEB 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15" />A yet ni irèn iyeng e ye, nɔng a di bisik washak bayɔng fɛ́ ngma kusum kusot bá se ni isam nek inyim iku. <verse eid="HEB 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16" />I se wɛshɛk fok, da batomaza ba fɛ̀ a ka ba sɛ mo awo, tit bafi izit aIbrahim ba. <verse eid="HEB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17" />Nek anɔng, fɛ́ ba ku sak mo na sot tɛ baruneng wu ayɛt akaakyi irèn, nɔng a da bin di sot Anet angmishish nɛ atsitsak Agbat-áware afi kutomong Adakunom, nɔng a di ki sok anɛn banet e. <verse eid="HEB 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18" />Nek iwu ice wu a mi bamang izot ni izen imara wu, nek anɔng a da kyem a gbinding bayɔng fɛ́ ba se ayɛt imara.<verse eid="HEB 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3" />
  <para style="s">AYeso a waat aMusa ni iratek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1" />Nek anɔng, ábaruneng fi i se yin jɛrɛ, iyin fi i mi sɛ yin kanu kafiin ni iyes sak azanɛn. Sak yin kuyiring yin naton aYeso fɛ́ a yet atom nɛ Agbat àware, ayɔng fi in ma fɛ̀ yin, in nɔɔk yit atsak ni wu. <verse eid="HEB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2" />AYeso ra kutomong wu na katsak sak na ayɔng fɛ́ a ku myak, kyɔn tɛ fɛ́ aMusa kin ra kutomong wu na katsak ayɛt banet Adakunom. <verse eid="HEB 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3" />AYeso kyem na ba ku nɔk iratek fi i naat ifɛ́ aMusa makiyi, kyɔn tɛ anet inok kutu a waat kutu me ikyɛng ko ni iratek. <verse eid="HEB 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4" />Kaakye kari bɛ̀ anet inok ka, awɛt Adakunom wu a yet anet inok akaakyi ikyɛng. <verse eid="HEB 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5" />AMusa ra kutomong wu na katsak tɛ asam ayɛt banet Adakunom. A tonong ifɛ̀ fɛ́ Adakunom bi tak ide sak ashon. <verse eid="HEB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6" />Awɛt Anet-Isheshek ra kutomong wu na katsak tɛ Arim e, fɛ́ a bi ice azaton ngma banet Adakunom. Iyit ba in yet yit banet wu me, ki in sot yit ni iyɛ ting, ni ite iyɛ fi in di ki tsot yit kugwɔm.<verse eid="HEB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikɔrɔk kuto naton iraye ishan atsak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7" />Nek anɔng, kyɔn tɛ fɛ́ Kabik aJɛrɛ fɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">&lt;&lt;Atut, ki ngɔn fok kutɔ wu,<verse eid="HEB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8" />i bi sot yin ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">kugbarak iyɛ awo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:8">kyɔn tɛ banet fɛ́ ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">kin dorok nhwyɛ awo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:8">ni izen fɛ́ ba kin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">di imara natse,<verse eid="HEB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9" />azɔng wu fɛ́ badakop yin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">kin di mara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">ba tɛ ba di bamang mo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:9">ngma ne fɛ́ ba kin di</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">ntomong hom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">fi in kin ras ina</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">ayɛ nsɔk nnaas.<verse eid="HEB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10" />Nek anɔng fi in kin beseng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">iyɛ hom na bafi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">kuzam kuyɔng, wat in fɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:10">&lt;Kaakyi izen kuyiring bá</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">se kpɛɛ ni imi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">ba rēn irén hom awo.&gt;<verse eid="HEB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11" />Ayɛt ibeseng iyɛ hom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:11">in nye kushii ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:11">&lt;Jɛm-jɛm, ba bi nɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:11">na nawu hom awo.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12" />Nye yin yɛɛt ábaruneng, iba sot yin ne ayɛ anyas ni iraye ishan atsak ayɛt ayɛ yin awo, fɛ́ i da ki sak yin ni tirik yin Adakunom atset kama. <verse eid="HEB 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13" />Tit ni i gbinding yin bafidang kaakyi izen. Ra yin kutomong na kaakyi kawat fi i sɛ yin, fɛ́ ba yes &lt;&lt;Atut&gt;&gt;, kɔn akak ayɛt yin bi se gbarak ni irèn fi inɛn di wɔrɔsɔ anet awo. <verse eid="HEB 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14" />Iyit bɛ̀ yit kanu kafiit na Anet-Isheshek, ki in bereng yit gak sak ni igang e, idɔng fi in tsang di te yit agap ni imɛsɛng e. <verse eid="HEB 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15" />Kyɔn tɛ fɛ́ ba tsin mɛsɛng fɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">&lt;&lt;Atut, ki ngɔn fok kutɔ wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">i bi sot gbarak awo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">kyɔn ti fi i kin te ni izen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">idorok nhwyɛ yame.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16" />A yet bangan ba fɛ̀ ba kin fok kutɔ Adakunom, ba ma dorok ni kuhwyɛ yɛ? Ngma ba, ba kin yet bayɔng fɛ́ aMusa kin wuruk ni ba ni mben aMasat awɛ? <verse eid="HEB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17" />A yet bangan ba fɛ̀ Adakunom kin di beseng iyɛ ayɛ nsɔk nnaas ni ba yɛ? Ba yet bayɔng fɛ́ ba ra inɛn, fi nkom bá kin kpas natse awɛ? <verse eid="HEB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18" />A kin yet bangan ba fɛ̀ Adakunom kin di shiwu jɛm-jɛm a bi nɔ na nawu wu awo yɛ? A kin yet iba me yɔng fɛ́ ba raba dang fok ifɛ̀ wu awɛ? <verse eid="HEB 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19" />Nek anɔng, in mi di yit, nek iraba ishan atsak bá ye fi i sak da ba kyem ba nɔ na nawu wu awo.<verse eid="HEB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4" />
  <para style="s">Ifɔn nek banet Adakunom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1" />Yɔkɔnɔng ana, ni irosom kushi Adakunom tsin rēn di se mo kufi inɔ ayɛt nawu wu, won ni in nye yit yɛɛt, kɔn da akak yin bi sɛ kurat inɔ ayɛt ifɔn e. <verse eid="HEB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2" />Iyit mi fok yit ishara Ifɛ̀ itek e deng, kpaf ti iba kin di fok. Awɛt itom ishara Ifɛ̀ me fɛ́ ba kin fok, ba di i ka ba se yɛɛt awo, nek anɔng, bayɔng fɛ́ ba fok Ifɛ̀ me, ba moon ishan de ni inɔɔk atsak awo. <verse eid="HEB 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3" />Awɛt iyit ba bang fi i mi ishan yit atsak e, iyit ba fi in da nɔ yit ifɔn e yɔng. Kyɔn tɛ Adakunom mi fɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">&lt;&lt;In shiwu ni kushi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:3">ayɛt ibeseng iyɛ hom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">&lt;Jɛm-jɛm, ba bi nɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:3">na nawu hom awo.&gt; &gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">Ngma ne anɔng, a mang tsang gang kutomong wu neme ni izen ita itis inye azatse. <verse eid="HEB 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4" />Narɔ kakak ba jɛk ni kufumung Adakunom naton kunom kufɛ́ kanakataat ye, &lt;&lt;Adakunom kin fɔn ni kunom kufɛ́ kanakataat, na akaakyɛ kuri kutomong wu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5" />Awɛt azeng narɔ ka kang e, a tɛ fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Jɛm-jɛm, ba bi nɔ na nawu hom awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6" />Ayame fɛ́ ba kin shara Ifɛ̀ itek e naton inɔ ifɔn e yeng, awɛt bayɔng fɛ́ ba kin ka ba shara Ifɛ̀ e me, da ba kyem ba nɔ iye awo nek kugbarak bá. Awɛt yɔkɔnɔng ana, kawat di se fɛ́ bakak da kyem ba di nɔ ifɔn e me yɔng. <verse eid="HEB 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7" />Nek anɔng, Adakunom tɛ a te kunom kukak, a yes iko, &lt;&lt;Atut,&gt;&gt; a cɛɛt naton kunom e me yɔng, ama ayɛ dot nanu agwɔm aDauda, kyɔn tɛ fi i kin di se ni jɛk yame ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">&lt;&lt;Atut, ki i fok yin kutɔ wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:7">i bi sot gbarak awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8" />Nek ke aJoshuwa fɛ́ tsang ka ba nɔk ifɔn e me yeng, ke Adakunom tɛ cɛɛt naton kunom kukak zɛɛt awo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">AJoshua tse ni iba ni mben e awɛt ifɔn ne yɔng e yet ifi igang e awo.</char></note><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 14:22">Kufumung Ifá 14:22</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="HEB 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9" />Ideng tonong fok, atut ana ifɔn ifɛ́ kunom anakataat e rēn di se nek banet Adakunom. <verse eid="HEB 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10" />Nek ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba nɔ ni ifɔn Adakunom e, ba fɔrɔng ayɛt ntomong mbɔk bá, kyɔn tɛ Adakunom kin di fɔn ni ku fuu.<verse eid="HEB 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11" />Nek anɔng, won in te yit nyɛk ni in nɔ yit ni ifɔn e yɔng. Da akak bi gaat i nɔ ni ifɔn e me awo, nek a kuus nggɔn bayɔng fɛ́ ba tonong kugbarak ice. <verse eid="HEB 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12" />Nek ifɛ̀ Adakunom yet itsɛt, i bɛ̀ agap ira kutomong. Iwaat kaakyi itsot afak afaa votot. I gosok sak ayɛt irɔm anet, ni kabasa iyɛ na kabik, ngma ni nkap na asisɔrɔng. I tsɛk ishɔt kuyiring ni nggɔn anet. <verse eid="HEB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13" />Vit ikyi ikak fi i se ni nɛt na ayisi Adakunom. Kaakyi ikyɛng se piyot, ni ti se gbɛngɛrɛng na ayisi wu. Iwu yɔng wu, fi in bi nyeseng yit ashon wu, ni in ku taas yit ngma nkyɔrɔk fi in kin mang ras yit.<verse eid="HEB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso yet Agbat-áware</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14" />Nek anɔng, in bɛ̀ yit agbat-áware aratek, aYeso Arim Adakunom, iwu yɔng fɛ́ a mi tse azanɛn ashon Adakunom. Nek anɔng, won in bereng yit gey inɔɔk atsak fi in mi taas yit na nanu yit. <verse eid="HEB 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15" />Nek da in bɛ̀ yit Agbat-agbat àware fɛ́ da a daam ni fok angmishish kurat yit awo. Nek iwu yet anet fɛ́ ba mi ku mara ni irén zizɛɛt ti iyit, ngma ne anɔng, a ra inɛn ikak awo. <verse eid="HEB 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16" />Nek anɔng, won ni in bɛ́ yit bakat ni kuta igwɔm Adakunom fi ku yet karɔ i sɛs itek, ni iyɛ ting. Nɔng in di ki sɛ yit angmishish wu ni itek wu fi i di ki sɛ yit mo, ni izen fi in shim yit.<verse eid="HEB 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1" />Kaakye agbat àware ba ku myak ayɛt banet, nɔng a bin ra Adakunom kutomong ami ma banet e. A nesek nnang ni inabak-akuce sak na Adakunom nek ikusu anɛn banet e. <verse eid="HEB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2" />Nek iwu ikyɛng wu a bɛ̀ kurat wu, nek anɔng a kyem a bereng bayɔng fɛ́ ba se vit irēn awo, nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba dun irèn yɛlɛl. <verse eid="HEB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3" />Ikyɛng e dɔng fi i sak, i se gbing-gbing iwu na teng nabak ashosh nek anɛn ice wu, a da ne tɛ a nabak nek anɛn banet.<verse eid="HEB 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4" />Vit anet fɛ́ a nɔɔk ice wu kutomong kuratek kang. Anet kyem a sot agbat àware awo, tit ma Adakunom ku yes mo, kyɔn tɛ a kin yes aHaruna. <verse eid="HEB 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5" />Idɔng kpaf anɔng na Anet-Isheshek, da a sok ice wu ni iratek ifi i sot agbat àware awo. Awɛt Adakunom kin fɛ̀ ni wu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">&lt;&lt;Atut! Ngɔn yet Arim hom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:5">imi mi sot Ada ngɔn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6" />A tɛ fɛ̀ narɔ kakak ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">&lt;&lt;Ngɔn yet àware</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:6">gbakgbak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">ni irèn fɛ́ aMelkizedek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:6">kin di se.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7" />Ni izen fɛ́ aYeso se ni kusot azatse, a ra awon ni irisim, na tos kanak na nayisi, na ta kutɔ gbɛrɛy sak na ayɔng fɛ́ a da kyem na ku sheshek ni iku. Adakunom ma fok kanak wu, nek iwu foos ifɛ̀ wu. <verse eid="HEB 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8" />Ngma ne anɔng, iwu yet Arim Adakunom, a mɛɛs ifoos ifɛ̀ ni izot yɔng fɛ́ a sɔ. <verse eid="HEB 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba mi ku shining gyat, a sot itis isheshek vit nkum sak ngma na bayɔng fɛ́ ba foos ifɛ̀ wu. <verse eid="HEB 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10" />Adakunom ku te a sot Agbat-agbat àware ni irèn fɛ́ aMelkizedek kin di se.<verse eid="HEB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikɔrɔk kuto naton <optbreak /> ikpas ni irèn ikuus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11" />In bɛ̀ yit nkyɔrɔk dot fi in shim in ki tak yin, awɛt i ki se yit gbang ni in ki tonong yin, nek i se yin kpɛt-kpɛt ni mɛɛs ni irēn. <verse eid="HEB 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12" />Atsak e yet, ki iyin mi kyem isot yin bafi itees bakak yɔkɔnɔng, awɛt i ni rēn resek yin itsɛt ba tɛ ba ki tees yin naban nkyɔrɔk ifɛ̀ katsak Adakunom nfi imɛsɛng e kong bà. Ke naban nnon, itsɛt yin ingasa nabasang kyɛk, da kuyak kukpakarak e awo. <verse eid="HEB 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a rēn sot na nabasang kyɛk, a rēn resek kaban nggon, a da kyem a rēn kusot kutek ni kuduk e awo. <verse eid="HEB 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14" />Awɛt kuyak kukpakarak e yet kufɛ́ banet bako. Bayɔng fɛ́ kaakyi izen ba tabak ace bá, na ba kyem ba kaba ikyɛng itek ni iduk e.<verse eid="HEB 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1" />Nek anɔng, won ni in ya yit kashon naton itees yeng ifi imɛsɛng e fi in ma shan yit azaton Anet-Isheshek, nɔng in bin sot yit ni irēn ifɛ́ banet bako. Da in da ti in bun yit ni itis itees naton iwosong anɛn sak itirik na Adakunom kyɛk awo, ni ifi inɔɔk atsak sak na Adakunom kyɛk bà awo, <verse eid="HEB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2" />ni ifɛ́ ira abatisma, ni isaas mbɔk naton ace banet, ni ifɛ́ idoro bafaben, ni itsɛɛt ishɔt igang azatse. <verse eid="HEB 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3" />Won nin in ya yit kashon! A yet ikyɛng dɔng fi in da ra yit yɔng, Ke Adakunom shim.<verse eid="HEB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4" />I da se gbang na ba tɛ ba tɛ tirik bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi barak inɔɔk atsak bá, na ba tɛ ba ka ba tirik sak ni ishan atsak. A yet iba me yɔng fɛ́ ba man se ayɛt mgbey Adakunom, ba mi bamang nta nnang kuri nfɛ́ azanɛn, ba mi sɛ kanu kafuba ayɛt Kabik aJɛrɛ, <verse eid="HEB 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5" />bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi tɛ ba bamang kusas Ifɛ̀ Adakunom, ni i sɛ ice irēn izen fi i bi bɛ́, <verse eid="HEB 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6" />Ngma ne anɔng, bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi barak ishan atsak bá, itonong ba da kyem ba tɛ ba bun ni ba sak ni ishan atsak e kong bà awo. Nek anɔng, ba tsin tɛ ba tekak Arim Adakunom, itekak ifɛ́ afaa. Ba tsin ku tes nsum ni idɛt yɔng bà.<verse eid="HEB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7" />Won in sok yit ane; Adakunom tes awɛng wu sak ni mben yɔng fi in saas ashi iza fi i irɔsɔp kaakyi izen, ni ikorok ica nayak natek fi in se yɛɛt sak na atek ikap e. <verse eid="HEB 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8" />Awɛt mben e yɔng fi in tang itsitsan ni kutsi, ikyi ikak itek ta ice ni na awo. In se na wey, kawɛy Adakunom. Ni igang e, ba bi di te kurong ni ina kyɛk.<verse eid="HEB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9" />Ábaruneng, ki in tsin cɛɛt yit anɔng, in rēn yit tsɛngtsɛng i bɛ̀ yin awɛng ni nkyɔrɔk fi in waat ni kusas. Iyɔng fi in tonong irèn isheshek yin. <verse eid="HEB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10" />Adakunom yet afi mbɔɔs awo. A da te burum ni ntomong fi iras yin awo, ni ishim fi i bɛ̀ yin sak ni wu, iyɔng fi i di sɛs yin mo bafi ikuus, ya yin kashon ne anɔng e. <verse eid="HEB 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11" />In shim yit kaangan yin na te nyɛk anɔng sak ni igang e, nɔng i da bi sɛ yin nkyɔrɔk yɔng fi i mi tsang di te yin iyɛ ni ina. <verse eid="HEB 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12" />Da in shim yit ni i sot yin bafɛ́ arut awo, tit ni mɛɛs yin na bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi tsang shan atsak, ni kusot akabɔk, Adakunom ma ka ba nɔk iya itekari fɛ́ a tsang shiwu a da ka ba nɔk.<verse eid="HEB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutsɛng-tsɛng kushi Adakunom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13" />Izen fɛ́ Adakunom nye kushi wu sak ne aIbrahim, a nye kushi me ni iyerek wu, nek vit anet fɛ́ a ku naat ni iratek fɛ́ a di ki nye kushi me ni wu. <verse eid="HEB 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14" />A fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Na tsak e, In da ka te mo awɛng, in da fuush izit ngɔn makiyi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15" />Ama fi aIbrahim mi tot na akabɔk, a da nɛ shan kushi me fɛ́ Adakunom mi tsang ku nye ne.<verse eid="HEB 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16" />Banet nyes kushi ni iyerek anet fɛ́ a ka ba naat ni iratek, ni nkyɔrɔk fi in se ayɛt kushi me sot atutup ifɛ̀, ni ti bɛ́ ni nkum ikaba kaakyɛ kuri nanan. <verse eid="HEB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17" />Na anɔng bà, Adakunom shim a tonong bayɔng fɛ́ ba shan kushi wu me wɛshɛk fok, atsak atsitsak, kuyiring wu bi ishesheng awo, nek anɔng, a di barang ni kushi. <verse eid="HEB 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18" />Adakunom nye anɔng, nɔng nek nkyɔrɔk nfaa fɛ́ da ba kyem ba shesheng ina awo. Jɛm-jɛm Adakunom da kyem a ra mbɔɔs awo. Iyit ba bang fi in mi sɛ yit ihwyet ni wu, anɔng e ki nɔk yit igbingding fi in di ki bereng yit ite iyɛ yit gak, fɛ́ a mi sak iye ashon yit.<verse eid="HEB 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19" />In bɛ̀ yit ite iyɛ fi i se ti igɔk agap fi ibereng kutset yit gak, nɔng in bin di sot yit ni iyɛ ting. Ite iyɛ me ye fi i ki tsaas yit ni in got yit kutaà sak ayɛt kayɛt itu iya Adakunom ntong kufɛ́ azanɛn.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="fk">kufɛ́ azanɛn</char>: <char style="ft" closed="false">Itonong karɔ fɛ Adakunom di se.</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20" />AYeso mi teng tse a nɔ aza yit, a nɔ azɔng e ashon yit. Azɔng e me fɛ́ a di sot Agbat-agbat àware afɛ́ ayɛ vit nkum e, ni irèn fɛ́ aMelkizedek kin di se.<verse eid="HEB 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7" />
  <para style="s">Àware aMelkizedek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1" />AMelkizedek yong a kin yet agwɔm aSalem, a tɛ a yet àware Adakunom Azɔk Bazɔk. A kin nyim ne aIbrahim ni ku bun wu, ni izen fi aIbrahim kin ya awɛng azaton bágwɔm bakak ni itsom. A da ma ku te mo awɛng. <verse eid="HEB 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2" />AIbrahim da ne a ku nɔk kigbasak ifɛ́ akaakyi ikyɛng fɛ́ a bɛ̀. Ni imɛsɛng e, iyerek aMelkizedek tonong, &lt;&lt;AGwɔm kusot kutabat&gt;&gt; nɛ &lt;&lt;AGwɔm aSalem&gt;&gt; tonong, &lt;&lt;AGwɔm kusot kukyang.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3" />A se dang ada ni nggɔ, dang atutup izit, dang kunom ites ni kufi iku wu, a se tɛ Arim Adakunom, a sot àware ayɛ vit nkum e.<verse eid="HEB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4" />Di yin kuri iratek fɛ́ anet yong bɛ̀. Fɛ́ adakop yit aIbrahim ku nɔk kigbasak akaakyi ikyɛng fɛ́ a foshok ina ni itsom. <verse eid="HEB 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5" />Ayɛt ntsi aMusa, bafi izit aLawi fɛ́ ba yet áware, ntsi ka ba nɔk kanu ishashang igbasak na banet, banet fɛ́ ba yet baruneng bá, ngma ne fɛ́ ba yet bafi izit aIbrahim bà. <verse eid="HEB 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6" />Awɛt aMelkizedek, iwu fɛ́ da a yet atutup afi izit aLawi awo, ngma ne anɔng, a shan kigbasak ni aIbrahim, a ma ku te mo awɛng, iwu fɛ́ ba mi tsang ku nye kushi. <verse eid="HEB 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7" />I se wɛshɛk fok, anet akoo wu a te ncicɛ na anet a wosong.<verse eid="HEB 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8" />Naton kucɛɛt áware fɛ́ ba ne ni izit baLawi, ba yet banet fɛ́ ba kus, ngma ne anɔng, ba shashang igbasak. Awɛt naton aMelkizedek, iwu fɛ́ ba nɔɔk kanu ifɛ̀ ni wu fok a se ni kutset, a shan igbasak ni aIbrahim. <verse eid="HEB 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9" />Anet da kyem a fɛ̀ fok, aLawi ni ice wu, fɛ́ bafi izit wu ba ba shashang igbasak, a nɔɔk ifuu ni bɔk aIbrahim. <verse eid="HEB 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10" />Nek in da kyem in fɛ̀ ane, izen fɛ́ aMelkizedek nyim ni aIbrahim, ba mi tsang tes aLawi ngma awo, a tsang resek ni irɔm izit aIbrahim ninyɛn.<verse eid="HEB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso tɛ aMelkizedek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11" />Kɔ di, nse iware kuri kufi izit aLawi fi ku ne gung ni Ntsi fɛ́ ba kin nɔɔk nnon aIsrela na ba kuus ina. Awɛt yɔkɔnɔng, fi se fok, kutomong áware bafi izit aLawi me, ifi i yet fok, i shining Ntsi me kpaf, zɔng ke àware akak tɛ a bɛ́ zɛɛt awo. Awɛt àware me yɔng fɛ́ a bɛ́ ni nse aMelkizedek, da ni nse aHaruna awo. <verse eid="HEB 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12" />Nek izen fɛ́ ba sɛ ishesheng ni kutomong iware, i se gbing-gbing na ba shesheng ntsi me bà. <verse eid="HEB 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13" />Nek iwu ayɔng fɛ́ ba cɛɛt nkyɔrɔk nang naton wu, iwu aTisa yit, a ne ni izit ikak zɛɛt. Vit akak ayɛt izit wu azining fɛ́ a mang ra kutomong inasap kunang ni kuta ashosh tɛ àware.<verse eid="HEB 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14" />Nek i se wɛshɛk fok, aTisa yit kin ne ni izɔrɔk aYahuda, aMusa kin fɛ̀ ikyi ikak naton izɔrɔk e yɔng awo, ni izen fɛ́ a kin cɛɛt naton áware. <verse eid="HEB 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15" />Imak se wɛshɛk ningya ni ikyɛng fi ma tsang tak yit ide, àware akak ne zɛɛt tɛ aMelkizedek. <verse eid="HEB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16" />Ayɔng fɛ́ a mi sot àware, da ni irèn ntsi kɛ ni nggɔn banet awo, tit ni irèn ice fi inɔɔk kutset vit nkum. <verse eid="HEB 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17" />Nek i se ni jɛk ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:17">&lt;&lt;Ngɔn yet àware ayɛ na ayɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:17">ni nse aMelkizedek.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18" />Ba kin wobok itees i yame, nek i se gbɛrɛk ni ifi kusot abap. <verse eid="HEB 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19" />Nek da itees ntsi aMusa bɛ́ ni ishining ikyi ikak yɛɛt awo. Awɛt yɔkɔnɔng, irèn ikak fi iwat i yame mi tarak ifi ite iyɛ, fi i sak in di ki serek yit bakat na Adakunom.<verse eid="HEB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20" />I kin se dang kushii Adakunom awo, Awɛt bakak kin sot áware dang kushii kukak. <verse eid="HEB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21" />Awɛt iwu sot àware ni kushii ni izen fɛ́ Adakunom fɛ̀ ni wu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">&lt;&lt;ATisa me man shiwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:21">a da shesheng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:21">kuyiring wu awo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">&lt;Ngɔn yet àware</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:21">ayɛ na ayɛ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22" />Nek kushii me kang ko, fi ku sak aYeso nyeseng naton atsitsak irèn imoon kushii Adakunom nɛ banet fi ku wat ni kusas.<verse eid="HEB 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23" />Kuri áware yame, ba kin se dot fi nek iku, ba kyem ba ya kashon ni kutomong iware bá awo. <verse eid="HEB 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24" />Awɛt nek aYeso di nak ni kutset, kusot iware wu se dang nkum. <verse eid="HEB 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25" />Nek anɔng, atut na katson, a da kyem na sheshek ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba bɛ́ na Adakunom ni iyerek wu. Nek iwu di nak ni kutset, a sot ni iras awon sak na Adakunom nek iba.<verse eid="HEB 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26" />Nek kuri agbat àware yong wu fɛ́ a ki tarasa yit ndaam yit. Ayɔng fɛ́ a se jɛrɛ, a se dang inɛn kɛ ikyi ikak iduk e awo, fɛ́ ba ku sak zɛɛt ne na bafi inɛn, ba tɛ ba ku nɔk iratek azaton nazanɛn. <verse eid="HEB 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27" />Iwu se zɛɛt ni ishɛrɛp bagbat áware me. Nek iwu da nasap nnang ashosh nninom awo, ifi imɛsɛng e, a teng nabak na fi inɛn ice wu, a da ne nabak na fɛ́ anɛn banet. A mi nabak inabak-akuce e ite kazining pɛɛt nek anɛn bá, ni izen fɛ́ a nabak ice wu. <verse eid="HEB 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28" />Ni itees ntsi aMusa, ntsi me fi ntonong irèn ite agbat àware fɛ́ a bɛ̀ kurat. Awɛt kushii fi ku ne ama Ntsi me, Adakunom sak Arim wu me na shining kpaf kusot Agbat àware ayɛ vit nkum.<verse eid="HEB 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8" />
  <para style="s">AYeso yet agbat àware <optbreak /> afi kushii kufas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1" />Ngma itin ikyɛng fi in tsin di cɛɛt yit deng yet; In bɛ̀ yit Agbat àware ayɔng fɛ́ a se ni isonong ni bɔk iyak ni kuta igwɔm Azɔk azanɛn. <verse eid="HEB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2" />Ayɔng fɛ́ a ra kutomong wu ayɛt Kutɔmɔng Iya Adakunom Ntong, na atsak kutɔmɔng fɛ́ aTisa ni ice wu a nok, da anet awe awo.<verse eid="HEB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3" />Kaakye agbat àware, ba ku te mok inasap nnang ngma nɛ ashosh. I se gbing-gbing Agbat àware yit na a bɛ̀ ikyɛng fɛ́ a da nabak ide bà. <verse eid="HEB 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4" />Ki iwu kin yet afɛ́ kazatse kang, ke a kin yet àware ngma ni ngane awo, nek banet tsang di se fi ntsi aMusa ka ba te mo ni inasap nnang e. <verse eid="HEB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5" />Kutomong fɛ́ áware me ras ayɛt itu iya Adakunom ntong e, kuyɔng fi ku yet nawu ikyɛng fi i se azanɛn. I se kpaf ni ikyɛng fi ite ne aMusa, ni izen fɛ́ a shim a nok kutɔmɔng e, Adakunom fɛ̀ ni wu ye, &lt;&lt;Rēn tsɛngtsɛng fok, i da nok kaakyi ikyɛng kpaf ti kuyɔng fɛ́ ba kin da tonong nawu me, ni izen fi ngɔn se naton ihwyanang e.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6" />Awɛt yɔkɔnɔng, ba mi nɔɔk aYeso kutomong iware fi kuwaat kufuba, nek iwu se nate irosom kushii Adakunom nɛ banet wu, fi kuwaat kuzen e. Kushii kunang e waat ni kusas, nek ba ta iko naton nkyɔrɔk ntek.<verse eid="HEB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7" />Nek ki i fi yet fok, kushii kufi imɛsɛng e kin se vit inye, ke ba tɛ ba te kukak kufɛ́ afaa awo. <verse eid="HEB 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8" />Awɛt Adakunom kin sɛ banet e ni kurat, nek anɔng, a di fɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">&lt;&lt;ATisa fɛ̀, izen bi bɛ́,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">fi in bi rosom kushii kufas</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">ne banet aIsrela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">ne banet aYahuda.<verse eid="HEB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9" />I bi se ti irosom kushii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">fi in ki nye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">ne badakop bá awo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">Ni izen yɔng fi in kin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">ka ba sok ni bɔk</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">in ka ba tun ni mben aMasat,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">nek da ba bereng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">irosom kushii hom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">na katsak awo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">In ma ka ba tirik kama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">aTisa tak anɔng.<verse eid="HEB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10" />Irosom kushii me kang</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">fi in da nye ne banet aIsrela.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">In bi te ifɛ́ hom ni kuyiring bá</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">ni in tin jɛk ide na ayɛ bá</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">ama izen e yɔng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">aTisa tak anɔng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">In da sot Adakunom bá,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">ni iba sot banet hom.<verse eid="HEB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11" />Da ma akak tɛ tees</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">afidang isot wu awo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">kɛ anet na tees arunyining ye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">&lt;Rēn aTisa me.&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">Nek ba bi di rēn ngma ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">i bi tumung e na a wosong bá</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">sak na akoo bá.<verse eid="HEB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12" />Nek in bi ka ba fuut anyas bá</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:12">in bi tin yiring</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:12">na anɛn bá kong awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13" />Ni izen fɛ́ ba yes irosom kushii ku kang &lt;&lt;kufas&gt;&gt; Iwu mi sak kufi imɛsɛng e kusot kuzen. Ngma ikyɛng fɛ́ ba mi yes ide izén, i sot i mi kop, idɔng i mi bɛ́ bakat iwey.<verse eid="HEB 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9" />
  <para style="s">Iya ntong ni kutɔmɔng azatse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1" />Irosom kushii kufi imɛsɛng e bi ntsi irèn iya ntong, ni Kutɔmɔng Iya Adakunom Ntong kufɛ́ azatse bà. <verse eid="HEB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2" />Ba kin nok kutɔmɔng e, na kayɛt kafi imɛsɛng e, ba yes ika Karɔ aJɛrɛ. Ayɛt ka, ba di sak ikyɛng isaas agaramun, nɛ atebul fɛ́ ba di saas akpam fɛ́ ba tun zɛɛt nek Adakunom. <verse eid="HEB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3" />Ama kupɛt ikpin itɛnɛng kutu ayɛɛt e kufɛ́ afaa, ba yes iko Karɔ aJɛrɛ ka fɛ́ Jɛrɛ. <verse eid="HEB 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4" />Na yɛɛt ko, ba sak kuta ashosh, ashosh nkɔn ntek, nɛ akwɔti irosom kushii. Ngma nkyɔrɔk nfaa nang, ba nye ina ni kutsɔm kuseng. Ayɛt akwɔti irosom kushii me yong, a bi itsɛn fɛ́ ba nye ni kuta kuseng nɛ amanna ayɛɛt e, ni ishɛn aHaruna fi iturup atap, nɛ áfak ata afaa afi irosom kushii. <verse eid="HEB 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5" />Naton akwɔti me yong, akerubim afi ízɔk Adakunom te gip ibo me fi iyet kuta igwɔm angmishish. Awɛt yɔkɔnɔng, in da kyem in cɛɛt yit nyɛk-nyɛk azaton nkyɔrɔk nang awo.<verse eid="HEB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6" />Izen fɛ́ ba mi nye nkyɔrɔk nang anɔng, áware me nɔɔs iras ntomong bá na kayɛt itu imɛsɛng e, kaakyi kunom. <verse eid="HEB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7" />Awɛt agbat-agbat àware wu aziwu kyɛk fɛ́ a nɔ ayɛt kayɛt itu kufɛ́ afaa me ite kazining kaakyi iyɛ. A nɔ azɔng awo, ma na nasok fɛ́ a da nabak nek inɛn ice wu, nɛ nek anɛn fɛ́ banet mi ras dang irēn bá. <verse eid="HEB 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8" />Ne anɔng, Kabik aJɛrɛ tonong fok irèn inɔ sak na Karɔ aJɛrɛ ka fɛ́ aJɛrɛ, mi tarak ninyɛn awo, ki izen fi Kutɔmɔng Iya Adakunom Ntong imɛsɛng e tsin rēn resek mo tsìk ni inyeseng. <verse eid="HEB 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9" />Ikyɛng ideng se tɛ nawu kuzam ayɔkɔnɔng, fi itonong fok, nnang nɛ ashosh fɛ́ ba man na ba nesek ina, da i kyem ni i karak kuyiring iyɛ anet yɔng fɛ́ a ya Adakunom ntong e awo. <verse eid="HEB 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10" />Nkyɔrɔk nang e se naton iyak, ni isɔ, ni ndiri-ndiri amok ikus afi nggɔn banet. Nkyɔrɔk e nang ngma in yet nfi irɔm kyɛk, fɛ́ ba di ras kutomong ni ina ninyen, tit izen inye nkyɔrɔk ni irèn ifas bɛ́.<verse eid="HEB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nasok Anet-Isheshek ná <optbreak /> na shining inabak-akuce</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11" />Izen fɛ́ Anet-Isheshek bɛ́ tɛ Abgat-àware afi nkyɔrɔk ntek fi in se yɔkɔnɔng azeng. A nɔ ayɛt kutɔmɔng iya ntong fi ku wat ni iratek nɛ kusas gyat makiyi, fɛ́ da ku yet inye ni mbɔk anet awe awo. Idɔng e ti itonong fok, ku yet ikyɛng fɛ́ ba nye ni nkyɔrɔk azatse nang awo. <verse eid="HEB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12" />Izen fɛ́ Anet-Isheshek kin nɔ ayɛt itu Karɔ aJɛrɛ ka fɛ́ aJɛrɛ me, a nɔ ite kazining pɛɛt. Da a nɔ na nasok ibón kɛ naban amúng awo, tit na nasok wu, na yɔng fɛ́ na sak in di sɛ yit ibisik ifi iyɛ vit nkum. <verse eid="HEB 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13" />Nasok ibón nɛ amúng ni intongkan kabi ishép inyak fɛ́ ba fim ina na bayɔng fɛ́ ba se gbiridik, nek i te cɛl nrɔm bá, kpaf ti nggɔn bá di se. <verse eid="HEB 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14" />Na anɛ fɛ́ ba da moon nasok aKristi? Iwu fɛ́ ayɛt kabik fɛ́ ka se vit nkum, a nabak ice wu vit inɛn sak na Adakunom, a di yɛs kuyiring yit ni nyes nkyɔrɔk fi in bes ni iku, nɔng in di ki ya yit Adakunom atset ntong.<verse eid="HEB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15" />Nek anɔng, Anet-Isheshek wu a yet anet a te afi irosom kushii kufas e, nɔng bayɔng fɛ́ ba ka ba yes, da shan kushii iya itekari fi i se vit nkum. Ana ke yɔkɔnɔng fɛ́ a mi iku, a sot itarang fi i ka ba bisik, ba sot washak ne na anɛn fɛ́ ba mi tsang ra ni izen irosom kushii imɛsɛng e me.<verse eid="HEB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16" />Azaton ifɛ̀ kushii inɔɔk iya itekari, i se gbing-gbing na ba tonong fok, anet fɛ́ a nye kushii me kang mi iku ninyɛn. <verse eid="HEB 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17" />Nek kushii inɔɔk iya itekari kpa kutomong ko ke anet inɔɔk e mi ku, awɛt ba da kyem ba ra kutomong ni iko awo, ke anet e rēn resek mo ni kutset. <verse eid="HEB 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18" />Ikyɛng e dɔng fi i sak irosom kushii imɛsɛng e di sɛ ku ya ngma ni in gaan e, dang nasok awo.<verse eid="HEB 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19" />Ama fɛ́ aMusa kin taas banet ngma kusum kaakyi agbat-ifɛ̀ fi i se ni ijɛk ntsi, a sok nasok ishép inyak nɛ na fi ibón, a kyere na ashi. A ma sok kadus ahisop nɛ awulu asɛng, a di fim nasok e naton kufumung ijɛk ntsi me nɛ naton banet ngma. <verse eid="HEB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20" />A da nɛ a fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Nasok nang yet na fi irosom kushii me, fɛ́ Adakunom te ni ibereng yin agbat ifɛ̀ me.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21" />Kpaf anɔng, aMusa kin fim nasok e naton kutɔmɔng nɛ na akaakyi ikyɛng fɛ́ ba di ra kutomong ni ina ni itu iya Adakunom ntong e. <verse eid="HEB 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22" />Na atsak e, Ntsi me fɛ̀ i se gbing-gbing na ba kusu bakat kaakyi ikyɛng ni irèn ifim nasok. Nek ke vit inosong nasok, i sot vit ifuut anɛn yɔng.<verse eid="HEB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23" />I sot gbing-gbing na ba kusu cɛ́l nkyɔrɔk nang na fɛ́ azatse fi in yet nawu nkyɔrɔk azanɛn. Awɛt ashosh nkyɔrɔk azanɛn iwaat se yɛɛt aza ifi imɛsɛng e. <verse eid="HEB 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24" />Nek da Anet-Isheshek kin nɔ karɔ ajɛrɛ fɛ́ banet nye ni mbɔk awo, fi ka kin yet nawu atsak e kyɛk. A yet kazanɛn ka fɛ́ a kin di nɔ, yɔkɔnɔng ana, a se ashon Adakunom akuce yit. <verse eid="HEB 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25" />Da Anet-Isheshek nɔ azanɛn nɔng a da bin tobok inasap ice wu, tɛ agbat àware me fɛ́ a mi di mɛɛ na nɔɔs na Karɔ aJɛrɛ kafɛ́ aJɛrɛ kaakyi iyɛ, na nasok fɛ́ da na yet nafuu awo.<verse eid="HEB 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26" />Nek ke Anet-Isheshek yɔng a sot ni isɔ izot ni izen dot, neme ni inye azatse. Awɛt yɔkɔnɔng, na ayɛ igang e nang, a mi tonong ice wu ite kazining pɛɛt, nɔng a da bin di tun anɛn ni irèn inabak-akuce fɛ́ a nɔɔk ice wu. <verse eid="HEB 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27" />Kyɔn ti fi i di se, ba te fok anet awe da ku kazining pɛɛt, ama anɔng, na tot ishɔt Adakunom. <verse eid="HEB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28" />I se anɔng bà, ba kin nabak Anet-Isheshek tɛ inabak-akuce sɔk kazining pɛɛt nek a di sok anɛn banet dot. A bi tɛ bɛ́, ibɛ́ ifɛ́ afaa, da nek i sok anɛn kong awo, tit na bɛ́ ni isheshek sak na bayɔng fɛ́ ba se ni itot wu.<verse eid="HEB 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10" />
  <para style="s">Ba nabak Anet-Isheshek <optbreak /> sɔk kazining pɛɛt <optbreak /> nek akaangan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1" />Ntsi me yet nawu kyɛk na fi nkyɔrɔk ntek fi in bi bɛ́ azeng ashon, da ina yet atutup nkyɔrɔk e ice na awo. Nek anɔng, jɛm-jɛm, i da kyem i sot nnang ashosh fɛ́ ba tobok inasap e ayiyɛ awo, nek ite tabat bayɔng fɛ́ ba shim ibɛ́ bakat nek iya Adakunom ntong. <verse eid="HEB 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2" />Ki i fi kyem inye anɔng e, ke ba kin man na wosong inasap nnang ashosh e awɛ? Ke bafi iya Adakunom ntong e mi sɛ ikusu cɛ́l ngma kusum, ke kuyiring naton anɛn bá ti ku ka ba daam awo. <verse eid="HEB 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3" />Awɛt inabak-akuce ayiyɛ me, ka ba bɛ́s ni kuyiring anɛn bá, <verse eid="HEB 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4" />nek i da se jɛm-jɛm, nasok amúng nɛ na fi ibón, da kyem na sok anɛn awo.<verse eid="HEB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5" />Nek anɔng, izen fɛ́ Anet-Isheshek bɛ́ na azatse, a fɛ̀ ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">&lt;&lt;Inabak-akuce ni nnang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">fi ngɔn shim awo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">tit kurɔm fi ngɔn nye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">nek imi.<verse eid="HEB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6" />Ngɔn sɛs itɛrɛk iyɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:6">nek nnang ashosh</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:6">ni inasap nnang</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:6">nek ikus anɛn.<verse eid="HEB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7" />In da ni in fɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">&lt;Woo Adakunom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:7">imi yong,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">kyɔn ti fi i se ni jɛk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">ni kufumung ifɛ̀ ngɔn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:7">imi bɛ́ nɔng in da bin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">ra ikyɛng fi ngɔn shim.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8" />Ni imɛsɛng e, a fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Inabak-akuce ni nnang, ni inabak-akuce nkyɛ-ari ni inasap nnang nek ikus anɛn, ngɔn shim awo, kɛ ni in da tɛrɛk iyɛ awo.&gt;&gt; A fɛ̀ anɔng e, ngma na fi ntsi me fɛ̀ na ba nesek ina. <verse eid="HEB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9" />A da ne fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Imi yong, in mi bɛ́ nɔng in ra ikyɛng fi ngɔn shim.&gt;&gt; A wobok irosom kushii imɛsɛng e ni ifam, nɔng a bin di te tsik ifɛ́ afaa me. <verse eid="HEB 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10" />Nek ayet ishim Adakunom e ye, fɛ́ ba ki te yit mo jɛrɛ, ni irèn inabak kurɔm aYeso Kristi ite kazining pɛɛt vit ibarang.<verse eid="HEB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11" />Kaakyɛ àware sot ni ira kutomong wu kaaki kunom, na tobok inesek nnang ashosh iyɔng fi in da kyem jɛm-jɛm ni in tun anɛn awo. <verse eid="HEB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12" />Awɛt Anet-Isheshek nabak ice wu sɔk kazining pɛɛt nek ikus anɛn banet kaakyi izen, a ma tsɛ a sonong ni bɔk iyak Adakunom. <verse eid="HEB 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13" />Neme ni izen yame, a se ni tot izen fɛ́ Adakunom bi sak bafi ifa ni wu na ba sot na ben atak wu. <verse eid="HEB 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14" />Nek inabak ashosh izizining yeng kyɛk, a di sak ngma bayɔng fɛ́ a mi ka ba kanang anɛn bá, ba sot jɛrɛ ayɛ vit nkum. <verse eid="HEB 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15" />Kabik aJɛrɛ bà, ka mi nɔɔk kanu ifɛ̀ kang ni yit. Ni imɛsɛng e, a fɛ̀,<verse eid="HEB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16" />&lt;&lt;Irosom kushii kang</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">fi in da nye ni iba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">ama izen e yɔng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">fi i bi bɛ́, aTisa fɛ̀.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">In bi te ntsi hom ayɛt ayɛ bá,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">ni in jɛk ina ayɛt ice bá.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17" />A ma tɛ ban fɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:17">&lt;&lt;Anɛn bá ni ibeseng ntsi bá</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:17">jɛm-jɛm, in da ti in yiring</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:17">ni ina awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18" />Wat izen fɛ́ ba mi fuut anɛn nang, vit ishɛrɛp inabak ashosh ikak fi i ti kyɛk nek anɛn.<verse eid="HEB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Won ni in serek yit <optbreak /> bakat na Adakunom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19" />Nek anɔng ábaruneng, in bɛ̀ yit iyɛ ting fi in di ki nɔ yit na Karɔ aJɛrɛ ka fɛ́ Jɛrɛ me kang, ni irèn inosong nasok ni iku aYeso. <verse eid="HEB 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20" />A tɛ a ki tarak yit irèn ifas, irèn ifi kutset, ni irèn sarak kukpin nitu iya ntong, fi i yet kurɔm wu. <verse eid="HEB 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21" />Wat yɔkɔnɔng, in bɛ̀ yit Agbat-agbat àware fɛ́ ngma igwɔm Adakunom se ni bɔk wu. <verse eid="HEB 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22" />Nek anɔng, won ni in serek yit bakat na Adakunom na atsitsak iyɛ fi itonong inɔɔk atsak yit. Na anɔng wu fɛ́ ba ki te yit mo jɛrɛ ni kuras iyiring iyɛ yit, ba tɛ ba kus nrɔm yit cɛ́l na ashi. <verse eid="HEB 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23" />Won ni in bereng yit gey ite iyɛ yit fi in ma tak yit ide wɛshɛk, nek iwu ayɔng fɛ́ a nye kushii me bɛ̀ atsak. <verse eid="HEB 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24" />Won ni in tsɛt yit irèn fi in di ki gbinding yit baruneng ni irèn itonong ishim, ni iras ntomong ntek. <verse eid="HEB 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25" />Won in ba birisi yit inyis yit gung awo, kyɔn tɛ fɛ́ bakak mi di mɛɛ ni kuri nggɔn e yɔng. Awɛt won ni in gbinding yit baruneng ni gya, i di mak imak e, fi in tsin di yit izen kubɛ́ Adakunom mi bɛ́ bakat.<verse eid="HEB 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26" />Ki iyit ni ishim iyɛ yit in sot yit ni iras anɛn, ama fi in ma shan yit irēn ifɛ̀ atsak, vit inabak ashosh akak fi i ti resek. <verse eid="HEB 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27" />Ama anɔng, aduk inyim ishɔt bi bɛ́ nɛ avɛt arong fɛ́ a bi hɛlɛm bafi ifa na Adakunom. <verse eid="HEB 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a rawu ifok ifɛ̀ ntsi aMusa, na ba ku fɛt, vit ifok angmishish wu, ke ba sɛ inɔɔk kanu ifɛ̀ banet bafaa kɛ bataat kyɛk naton wu, <verse eid="HEB 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29" />se ngɔn yɔng i di, i bi se anɛ ne ayɔng fɛ́ a byɛs Arim Adakunom, a sok nasok irosom kushii fi ku kus anɛn banet jɛrɛ i sot abap, a tɛ a di tosong Kabik kang fɛ́ ka bɛ́ ni itek! Akyɛ kuri ishɔt fi iwaat iduk e fi i di yin i da se yɛɛt ne anet yong ɛ? <verse eid="HEB 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30" />Nek in rēn yit iwu ayɔng fɛ́ a fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;I yet inaan, ni in ka ba bun na anyas bá, ni in ti in ka ba tarang mo bà.&gt;&gt; A tɛ a fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;ATisa bi ra banet wu ishɔt.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31" />I yet ikyɛng inyim makiyi, anet na kpa ni bɔk Adakunom atset.<verse eid="HEB 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32" />Yiring yin ni nnom ayame. Ama fi i mi sɛ yin mgbey Adakunom, i te yin gbinding ni izen isɔ izot makiyi. <verse eid="HEB 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33" />Ni izen ikak, ba ki tosong yin ni idɛt, na ba ki zoot yin ashon banet. Ni izen ikak bà, ni ishim imoon yin ice na bayɔng fɛ́ ba sɔ kuri izot deng anɔng kpaf ti iyin. <verse eid="HEB 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34" />Iyin kin fok yin angmishish na bayɔng fɛ́ ba se ari inyang, ni ti ishan yin ni iyɛ ikan akɔn yin, ke ba ki foshok yin ares, nek i tsang rēn yin fok, i bɛ̀ yin kurúm fi kuwaat ni kusas fi ku da sot vit nkum.<verse eid="HEB 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35" />Nek anɔng, i bi te yin nwaa kuting iyɛ yin awo, nek i bi ki bɛ́ yin ni izang iratek. <verse eid="HEB 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36" />I se yɛɛt ni te yin gbinding, nɔng i da ra yin kpaf ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom shim, ama me, i da bin shan yin ikyɛng fɛ́ a mang nye kushii, a da ki nɔk yin. <verse eid="HEB 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37" />Ti i di se ni ijɛk fok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">&lt;&lt;Ni kizen gyeet,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">fɛ́ ka resek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">iwu fɛ́ a da bɛ́ me, a da bɛ́,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">a da raan wu awo.<verse eid="HEB 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38" />Awɛt afɛ́ kusot kutabat hom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">a da sot ni kutset</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">ni irèn inɔɔk atsak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:38">Awɛt ke a tɛ a bun na kama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">Iyɛ hom bi tɛrɛk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">ni iwu awo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39" />Awɛt iyit yet yit kuri bayɔng fɛ́ ba bushung na kama, na ba di wes awo. Tit bayɔng fɛ́ ba shan atsak, fɛ́ ba sɛ isheshek.<verse eid="HEB 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11" />
  <para style="s">Ikyɛng fi itonong inɔɔk atsak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1" />Inɔɔk atsak yet irēn tsɛngtsɛng ni nkyɔrɔk ite iyɛ, ni irēn wɛshɛk nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ ba kyem ba di ina awo. <verse eid="HEB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2" />A yet inɔɔk atsak e yeng ye fi i sak Adakunom di shim adakop ayame. <verse eid="HEB 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3" />Ni inɔɔk atsak e ye fi in di rēn yit fok ba kin nye kazatse ni ifɛ̀ Adakunom, nɔng in da rēn yit fok nkyɔrɔk nang fi in yɛrɛ yit ina, ba nye ina ni nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ in tsang di se awo.<verse eid="HEB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4" />Ni inɔɔk atsak ye, fɛ́ aHabila kin nɔɔk Adakunom inabak-akuce fi kuwaat kufɛ́ aKayinu ni kusas. Na anɔng wu fɛ́ Adakunom ku tere mo tɛ anet kusot kutabat, nek Adakunom shan nnang wu. Ngma fɛ́ aHabila me mi iku, awɛt nek inɔɔk atsak wu, a rēn cɛɛt atut.<verse eid="HEB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5" />Ni inɔɔk atsak ye fɛ́ ba kin sok aEnɔk ni kutset, a kin di iku awo, nek Adakunom kin ku sok fyew, wɛrɛng. Ni izen fɛ́ a resek dang na ba ku sok e, Adakunom kin ku tere ye, a yet anet fɛ́ a tɛrɛk Adakunom iyɛ. <verse eid="HEB 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6" />Ke dang ni inɔɔk atsak, vit anet fɛ́ a da kyem na tɛrɛk Adakunom iyɛ, nek ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a serek bakat na Adakunom, i se gbing-gbing na shan atsak fok Adakunom di se, nɛ fok, Adakunom da nɔɔk bayɔng fɛ́ ba ku tsɛt na tsak izang bá.<verse eid="HEB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7" />Ni inɔɔk atsak ye fi i sak aNuhu kin di fok itabak Adakunom naton nkyɔrɔk fi in resek dang te. A fok ifɛ̀ Adakunom, a di nok kukyɛ ashi fɛ́ a di sheshek bafɛ́ ari wu. Anɔng e wu i sak ba di tsɛɛt kazatse ishɔt, wat iwu di sot afi iya itekari, afi kusot tabat fi ines ni inɔɔk atsak.<verse eid="HEB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8" />Ni inɔɔk atsak ye fi aIbrahim, izen fɛ́ Adakunom ku yes fok na a tseng sak ni mben fɛ́ ku da ni kusot ku fuu, a fok ifɛ̀ me, a tseng, ngma ne fɛ́ da a tsang rēn karɔ fɛ́ a di ki tse me awo. <verse eid="HEB 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9" />Ni inɔɔk atsak, a sot tɛ a tseng ni mben fɛ́ Adakunom ku nye kushii a da ku nɔk. A sosok ayɛt abut, bi aIshaku nɛ aYakub yɔng anɔng bà. Ba kin yet bafi ishan kushii iya itekari me gung ni iwu. <verse eid="HEB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10" />AIbrahim kin ta ayisi sak ashon, nɔng a di ki di kuwɔp fɛ́ ba ta itis e, fɛ́ ayɔng fɛ́ jirim ko ni inok ko, yet Adakunom.<verse eid="HEB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11" />Ni inɔɔk atsak ye fɛ́ ngma ni ikop aIbrahim pusuk, ni ikuma fɛ́ aSara kin di se, ngma na anɔng, Adakunom ku sak a sot atek nggon, nek a rēn fok anet fɛ́ a ku nye kushii me, a bɛ̀ katsak. <verse eid="HEB 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12" />Nek anɔng, ni irɔm anet azining yong fɛ́ a mi kop bakat iku, a bɛ́ a sɛ izit fi kudot e se tɛ ádat atomaza, ni ku josh e se ti izɛk anu ashi izek.<verse eid="HEB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13" />Di yin! Ngma banet e bang kusum ba kin nɔɔk atsak bá sak na Adakunom sak ama iku bá. Da ba kin tsang shan nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ Adakunom kin ka ba nye kushii me awo, ba di ina ayɛt ayɛ bá kyɛk, awɛt ba shan ina ni in tsin resek yik-yik, ba kin bɛ̀ iyɛ ikan fɛ́ ba di ina. Ba rēn wɛshɛk fok iba yet batsen fɛ́ ba se ni kutseet azatse. <verse eid="HEB 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14" />Banet fɛ́ ba cɛɛt anɔng, ba tonong wɛshɛk, fok iba tsin tsɛt mben fi in da sot nfuba. <verse eid="HEB 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15" />Ke ba kin fɛ́ ba sak kuyiring bá naton mben fɛ́ ba mi won ina, ke ba mang tɛ ba tsɛt irèn ibun ni ina. <verse eid="HEB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16" />Wat tɛ ane ningya, ba kin waat ni te iyɛ ni mben fi in waat ni kusas, fi in yet kazanɛn. Nek anɔng, Adakunom foos nsum na ba ku yes Ada bá awo, nek iwu mi nye kuwɔp nek iba.<verse eid="HEB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17" />Ni inɔɔk atsak, ni izen fɛ́ Adakunom kin mara aIbrahim ye, na a nabak aIshaku inabak-akuce. Iwu fɛ́ a mi shashang kushii me, a mi kana nye nɔng a da nabak inabak-akuce arim wu azining pɛɛt e. <verse eid="HEB 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18" />Ngma na fɛ́ Adakunom mi fɛ̀ ni wu ye, &lt;&lt;A yet ni aIshaku wu fɛ́ ba bi di fa izit ngɔn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19" />AIbrahim kin rēn ni iyɛ wu fok, Adakunom da kyem a donong nkom, in da kyem in fɛ̀ yit, aIbrahim kin tɛ a shan aIshaku ni kutset. <verse eid="HEB 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20" />Ni inɔɔk atsak, aIshaku kin te ncicɛ na aYakub na aIsuwa ni nkyɔrɔk ntek fi in bi bɛ́ ashon bá. <verse eid="HEB 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21" />Ni inɔɔk atsak, izen fɛ́ aYakub bɛ́ bakat na a ku, a te yɛndɛng na agbanding wu ni iya Adakunom ntong, a di te kaakyi nggon aYusufu ncicɛ.<verse eid="HEB 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22" />Ni inɔɔk atsak, izen fi iku aYusufu bɛ́ bakat, a kin tak ibes kuwuruk nnon aIsrela na aMasat, a kin nɔɔk ifɛ̀ abes azaton akup wu.<verse eid="HEB 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23" />Ni inɔɔk atsak, izen fɛ́ ba kin tes aMusa, batèk tsɛ ba ku nɛt nfi nfɛn ntaat, nek ba di fok, a yet ihwyas nggon awo, nek anɔng ba fok nnyim itsɛɛt ishɔt agwɔm awo.<verse eid="HEB 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24" />Ni inɔɔk atsak, ni izen fɛ́ aMusa mi rasak, a kin rawu na ba ku yes arim angas aFirauna. <verse eid="HEB 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25" />A kin kasa ba ku nesek izot gung na banet Adakunom, aza fɛ́ a da ya nta isot ni iras anɛn nfi kizen gyeet kyɛk. <verse eid="HEB 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26" />A kasa ba ku tes nsum nek Anet-Isheshek ku wat e ni iratek, aza kurúm aMasat, nek a kin bɛ̀ ite iyɛ a bi sɛ izang wu sak ashon. <verse eid="HEB 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27" />Ni inɔɔk atsak, aMusa kin won mben aMasat, vit ifok nnyim naman agwɔm e awo. A tsɛsɛk nek a kin di iwu ayɔng fɛ́ a se ni nɛt. <verse eid="HEB 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28" />Ni inɔɔk atsak, aMusa kin sak na ba ra Amok aPasova, ni ifim nasok na atitu, nɔng ke atom ifɛɛs nnon imɛsɛng e a got, a da won na fi aIsrela.<verse eid="HEB 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29" />Ni inɔɔk atsak, nnon aIsrela kin tat Kugbat Kukyɛk Kuseng ni mben nkoot, awɛt izen fɛ́ bafɛ́ aMasat fɛ́ mara itaat e, ashi ka ba ya.<verse eid="HEB 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30" />Ni inɔɔk atsak, abat iwɔp aJeriko kpas, ama fi nnon aIsrela mi gorok ina ayɛt nkɔs kanakataat.<verse eid="HEB 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31" />Ni inɔɔk atsak, inyak agwɔm aRahab, nek a shan bafi ifarang narɔ bafi aIsrela, nek anɔng, da ba kin ku fɛt mo gung ni ishɛrɛp bayɔng fɛ́ ba se gbarak awo.<verse eid="HEB 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32" />Akyɛ fi in da tin in fɛ̀ kong ɛ? In bi izen fi in di ki cɛɛt naton aGidiyɔn, kɛ aBarak, kɛ aSamson, kɛ aJefta, kɛ aDauda, kɛ aSamela, kɛ ishɛrɛp batan awo, <verse eid="HEB 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33" />bayɔng fi ni inɔɔk atsak, ba ya bágwɔm mben zizɛɛt ni itsom, ba ras ishɔt atsak, ba shan ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom kin ka ba nye kushii me ne. Ba faam nanu akukum, <verse eid="HEB 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34" />ba riming kuvɛɛt árong, ba hwyet iku awal. Bayɔng fɛ́ Adakunom tirik kugbɛrɛk bá sak na agap, ba sɛ kugap ni ira itsom, ba di ya bayɔng fɛ́ ba bɛ́ ba ka ba kyere ni itsom.<verse eid="HEB 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35" />Banyining tɛ ba shashang nkom bá, fɛ́ ba donoso ina ni kutset. Ba zoot bakak bá, ba raba ba ka ba bisik washak, nɔng ba bi di sɛ idoro ifaben itek. <verse eid="HEB 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36" />Ba fɛɛs na ba hwyereng bakak ba, na ba tɛ ba rosom bakak ni inyang, na ba ka ba yirik ari inyang. <verse eid="HEB 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37" />Ba ka ba bara na ata, ba ka ba sarak nate ni ítsot-anyi, ba ka ba fɛɛs na awal. Ba teng ba kat na akpa itsamang na afi ibón ni nrɔm bá, ba se ayɛt avit kpɛt-kpɛt, ni kusot ni izoot, ni iyɔm. <verse eid="HEB 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38" />Ni iba, kazatse ka ba yet karɔ isot awo. Ba teng ba kat ne natse, nɛ naton ahwyanang, na ba kɔs na atas nɛ ayɛt ábóng.<verse eid="HEB 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39" />Ngma ba, ba kin sɛ itere nek inɔɔk atsak bá, ngma na anɔng, vit azining ba fɛ̀ a kin tsang sɛ ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom kin nye kushii me. <verse eid="HEB 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40" />Nek Adakunom kin man nye ikyɛng fi iwaat ni itek, nɔng iba da kyem ba sɛ ikyɛng fi i yet igyat e me, dang iyit awo.<verse eid="HEB 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12" />
  <para style="s">Irèn fɛ́ bafi inɔɔk atsak <optbreak /> ki gbingding yit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1" />Nek anɔng, in bɛ̀ yit kudyɛng banet anu icɛɛt fɛ́ ba ki te yit nate, won in barak yit kaakyi ikyɛng fi i ki tɛnɛsɛ yit nɛ anɛn fɛ́ a sot agunung yit kaakyi izen. Won ni in te yit nyɛk ni i tsi fɛ́ ba mi sak ashon yit. <verse eid="HEB 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2" />Won ni in ta yit ayisi yit naton aYeso, iwu yɔng fɛ́ a yet itumung ni igang inɔɔk atsak yit. Iwu fɛ́ nek itɛrɛk iyɛ fɛ́ ba mi sak ashon wu, a te gbinding ni mgbang itekak, a daam ni nsum e awo. A sonong ni bɔk iyak kuta igwɔm Adakunom. <verse eid="HEB 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3" />Yiring yin ni wu yɔng fɛ́ a te gbinding ni iraye ni bɔk bafi inɛn, kɔn i bi rɔrɔng yin na ki te yin gbɛrɛk.<verse eid="HEB 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4" />Ayɛt igigashang yin na anɛn, igigashang yin mi kyem sak inosong nasok awo. <verse eid="HEB 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5" />Iyin mi te burum yin ni kucɛɛt ite gbagba fok iyin yet yin nnon hom ɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">&lt;&lt;Arim hom, i bi byɛs</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:5">itabak aTisa awo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">I bi te gbɛrɛk ni izen fɛ́</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:5">ba da kɔn awo.<verse eid="HEB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6" />Nek aTisa me nye bayɔng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:6">fɛ́ a ka ba shim anɔng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:6">iwu tabak bayɔng fɛ́</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:6">a ka ba shan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:6">ba sot nnon wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7" />Nye yin gbinding ayɛt mgbang, sok yin ina ti itabak fɛ́ Adakunom nyes nnon wu ne, nek akyi nggon fɛ́ da ada ka won dang ka ka tabak ɛ? <verse eid="HEB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8" />Ke da ba ki tabak yin tɛ ba di tabak ngma nnon awo, idɔng tonong fok, iyin yet yin ashaam nnon, da natitup nnon awo. <verse eid="HEB 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9" />Ama anɔng, in bɛ̀ yit bada yit ni irɔm fɛ́ ba ki tabasa yit, ni in ka ba foos yit ifɛ̀, i da wat se yɛɛt ni in shan yit itabak Ada yit afɛ́ abik nek ni di sɛ yit kutset awɛ? <verse eid="HEB 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10" />Bada yit ni irɔm ki tabasa yit in fi kizen hyiit, gyat ni ku di bá, awɛt Adakunom ki tabasa yit nek itek yit, nɔng in sɛ yit kanu kafiit ayɛt kusot ajɛrɛ wu. <verse eid="HEB 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11" />Vit itabak fi i ta ni izen fɛ́ ba se ne, tit ibeseng iyɛ kyɛk, awɛt ama anɔng, ni ki bɛ́ yit ni imen iyɛ ni kusot kutabat sak na bayɔng fɛ́ ba shan itabak e.<verse eid="HEB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Igyɔng naton iraye Adakunom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12" />Nek anɔng, sok yin mbɔk yin fi in mi rɔrɔng, nɛ akuut yin fɛ́ a mi te gbɛrɛk. <verse eid="HEB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13" />&lt;&lt;Nye yin irén tɛlɛl fi i di ki gosok yin,&gt;&gt; kɔng ámɛrɛk bi ka na tsip mo, aza i sɛ kukyang.<verse eid="HEB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14" />Nye nyɛk yin, sot yin kyang na akaangan, sot yin jɛrɛ, nek vit anet fɛ́ a da kyem a di aTisa ke da a se jɛrɛ awo. <verse eid="HEB 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15" />Nye yin yɛɛt, kɔng akak bi ki tirik yin ni i won yin itek Adakunom. Kɔng akak bi sot tɛ kukpashak kuney fi ki ku rasak ni ku bɛ́s ni ndaam ni ibeseng ishɛrɛp banet dot. <verse eid="HEB 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16" />Nye yin yɛɛt, kɔng akak bi beseng ice ni kubi, kɛ na a sot vit ntsi Adakunom ti aIsuwa, fɛ́ a rɛp iya itekari wu ti nggon imɛsɛng e nek kuyak iya kazining kyɛk. <verse eid="HEB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17" />Ama anɔng, kyɔn ti i di rēn yin, ni izen fɛ́ a tsɛt a ya itekari itek e, ba kin ku rone ni ide. Nek a kyem a shesheng ikyɛng fɛ́ a tsang nye me awo, ngma na nayisi fɛ́ a wosong korok ina.<verse eid="HEB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18" />Nek iyin mi bɛ́ yin tɛ bafi aIsrela kin tse awo, ni ikyɛng fi da kyem ira yin, ni ihwyanang aSinay, fi i tsin ron na abelem árong, ni kurin hwyining, ni itsombos, <verse eid="HEB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19" />ni ifɛsɛm igba, ni ifoos kutɔ. Izen fɛ́ banet fok kutɔ me, na ba kpa tsot akabɔk ye da ba shim ba tɛ ba fok iko awo, <verse eid="HEB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20" />nek iba da kyem ba nye ikyɛng fi ifɛ̀ me fɛ̀ na ba nye awo, ye, &lt;&lt;Ke ni iyet inyam fi ira ihwyanang e ayi, ba da woro iye na ata.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21" />Karɔ me kin yet ikyɛng inyim makiyi, fi i sak aMusa di fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Kurɔm hom tiim nek inyim.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22" />Awɛt iyin mi bɛ́ yin ni ihwyanang aSihiyona, sak na aRushelima azanɛn, kuwɔp Adakunom atset. I mi bɛ́ yin sak narɔ fɛ́ kudyɛng batomaza di nyim ni iyɛ ikan, <verse eid="HEB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23" />I mi bɛ́ yin sak ni inyim iyɛ ikan ifi nnon imɛsɛng Adakunom, na yɔng fɛ́ ayerek bá se ni ijɛk azanɛn. I mi bɛ́ yin sak na Adakunom anet ishɔt banet kusum, i mi bɛ́ yin sak na nabik banet batek fɛ́ ba mi ka ba nye tabat, <verse eid="HEB 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24" />i mi bɛ́ yin narɔ aYeso fɛ́ a yet anet inyeseng nate irosom kushii kufas, i mi bɛ́ yin sak ni ifim nasok fɛ́ na cɛɛt ifɛ̀ fi iwaat nasok aHabila.<verse eid="HEB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25" />Nye yin yɛɛt, kɔng i bi rayin ayɔng fɛ́ a cɛɛt. Ke bayɔng fɛ́ ba kin raba ifok itabak wu azeng azatse, kin kyem ba hwyet awo, na akyɛ kuri irèn fi iyit da hwyet yit ɛ? Ki iyit tirik yit kama na ayɔng fɛ́ a se azanɛn fɛ́ a ki tabat yit ɛ? <verse eid="HEB 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26" />Ni izen yɔng, kutɔ wu kin zuut kazatse, awɛt yɔkɔnɔng a mi nye kushii, &lt;&lt;In bi tin zuut kazatse azika awo, tit ngma na kazanɛn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="HEB 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27" />Ifɛ̀ me deng, &lt;&lt;in bi tin&gt;&gt; tonong fok, ba bi ngaat ngma nkyɔrɔk yɔng fi in zuut, nɔng in yɔng fi da in zuut awo, bi di nak.<verse eid="HEB 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28" />Nek anɔng, a yet iyit tsin shan yit igwɔm fɛ ba da kyem ba zuut ide awo, i se gyat ni in tere yit Adakunom, ni in ku ya yit ntong ayɛt ishim iyɛ iratek ayɛt itiim irɔm, <verse eid="HEB 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29" />nek &lt;&lt;Adakunom yit yet kurong fi ku ya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 12:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13" />
  <para style="s">Itabak igang e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1" />Ya yin kashon ni itonoso ishim sak na bafidang tɛ baruneng. <verse eid="HEB 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2" />I bi te burum yin dang shashang yin batsen awo, nek ishashang batsen, bakak mi ya na batomaza dang rēn. <verse eid="HEB 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3" />Yiring yin ne bayɔng fɛ́ ba se na nasa-inyang, ti iyin se yin gung ni iba azɔng, nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba ka ba nesek iyɔm, ti i tsin sɔ yin mgbang gung ni iba.<verse eid="HEB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4" />Won kaangan na nesek kuweneng iratek de, won kameneng iweneng na ka sot cɛ́l, nek Adakunom bi ra bafi iras irɔs nɛ bafi iras kubi ishɔt. <verse eid="HEB 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5" />Won nggɔn yin bi sot in fi ishim itsɔm awo, won ikyɛng fi i bɛ̀ yin i ki kyem yin, nek Adakunom fɛ̀ ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:5">&lt;&lt;Imi bi ki wosong yin awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:5">jɛm-jɛm;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:5">imi bi ki tirik yin kama awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:5">jɛm-jɛm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6" />Nek anɔng in cɛɛt yit na agap iyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">&lt;&lt;ATisa wu a di sɛs mo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:6">In da fok inyim awo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">Akyɛ fɛ́ anet kyem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:6">a di ki nye ne yɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="HEB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7" />Yiring yin na bakɔk-ashon yin, bayɔng fɛ́ ba ki tees yin ifɛ̀ Adakunom. Di yin nggɔn isot bá, ni mɛɛs yin inɔɔk atsak bá. <verse eid="HEB 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8" />AYeso Kristi mi shesheng awo, a se tɛ a di se ni ire, atut, na katson.<verse eid="HEB 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9" />I bi wosong yin ndiri-ndiri itees ni in ki tiri yin awo. I se gyat ayɛ yin na a sɛs agap ni itek fi ines na Adakunom, da naton ntsi amok iyak awo, fɛ́ da a bi itek ikyi ikak sak na bayɔng fɛ́ ba ya ina awo. <verse eid="HEB 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10" />In bɛ̀ yit kuta ashosh kukak fɛ́ bayɔng fɛ́ ba ra kutomong ni kutɔmɔng e, ba bi irèn iyak ni ko awo.<verse eid="HEB 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11" />Nek agbat-agbat àware, a tses na nos nasok inyam ari me sak na Karɔ aJɛrɛ me, nek inabak kunang ifuut anɛn, awɛt ba shosh inam e amatse karɔ inyis. <verse eid="HEB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12" />Nek anɔng aYeso sɔ izot ama iwɔp bà, nɔng a di sak banet ba di sot jɛrɛ nek nasok wu. <verse eid="HEB 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13" />Nek anɔng, won in tse yit ni wu ama wɔp, nɔng in bin di sɔ yit nsum gung ni iwu. <verse eid="HEB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14" />Nek azeng azatse, in bɛ̀ yit kuwɔp fi ku di ki nak awo, in tsin tsɛt yit kuwɔp fi ku bi bɛ́.<verse eid="HEB 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15" />Won ni in ya yit kashon inabasa kunang itere sak na Adakunom ayɛt aYeso. Kucɛɛt anu yit fi ku nesek kanu sak ni iyerek Adakunom. <verse eid="HEB 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16" />I bi te burum yin inye itek, ni kabasa yin ikyɛng fi i bɛ̀ yin na bakak awo, nek kuri kunang kuyɔng ko ku tɛrɛk Adakunom iyɛ. <verse eid="HEB 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17" />Foos yin bakɔk-ashon yin, nye yin ikyɛng fɛ́ igwɔm fɛ̀. Iba ba ba tsin ki yɛrɛ yin tɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba bi nɔɔk ifɛ̀ naton yin. Ka ba foos yin nɔng kutomong bá bin se ni itɛrɛk iyɛ, da ni ku sot kunanang awo, nek anɔng e da ki bɛ́ yin ni itek awo.<verse eid="HEB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18" />Ki ras yit awon. Iyit rēn yit fok ayɛ yit yet akan, in shim nye yit kusot kutek na akaakyi irèn. <verse eid="HEB 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19" />In tsin ra awon ni yin fok, ni ra yin awon nɔng ba bin bun ni imi ni yin ayɛt izen.<verse eid="HEB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Awon igang e ni ite awɛng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20" />Won Adakunom fɛ́ a shim kusot kukyang, iwu fɛ́ a donong aTisa yit aYeso ni iku, agbat anek ítsamang, na anɔng wu fɛ́ ba di rosom kushii ayɛ vit nkum ne nagang nasok wu. <verse eid="HEB 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21" />Won na a ki nɔɔk yin kaakyi itek fi i da sak ni i nye yin kushim iyɛ wu, won iwu na a nye ngma ikyɛng fɛ́ a shim ayɛt yit, fi i da ne na aYeso Kristi, iwu fɛ́ ba da ku tere ayɛ vit nkum. Anɔng.<verse eid="HEB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22" />Ábaruneng, in tsin ra awon ni yin fok, nye yin akabɔk ni itabak hom, nek in mi ki jɛk yin kaban fumung kang.<verse eid="HEB 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23" />In shim ni i rēn yin fok, ba mi bisik aruneng yit aTimoti ari inyang. Ke a wat bɛ́s wu, in bi bɛ́ in ki di yin gung ni iwu.<verse eid="HEB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24" />Te show yin ngma bakɔk-ashon yin, ni ishɛrɛp banet Adakunom. Baruneng fɛ́ ba ne na aItaliya tsin ki tom yin ashow bà.<verse eid="HEB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25" />Won itek Adakunom ni se gung ni iyin ngma.<verse eid="HEB 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13" />
</usx>